<figure class="decision" aria-labelledby="r27-decision-title">
 <figcaption id="r27-decision-title"><span>Figure 2</span> The decision must outlive its coordinator</figcaption>
 <commit-story>
  <label>History <select data-history><option value="normal">Both participants finish</option><option value="prepared">Coordinator lost after prepare</option><option value="decided">Coordinator lost after A commits</option></select></label>
  <div class="states" data-live><section><p class="panel-title">Coordinator’s durable decision</p><p data-coordinator>No decision</p></section><section><p class="panel-title">A · stock participant</p><p data-stock>Working</p></section><section><p class="panel-title">B · order participant</p><p data-orders>Working</p></section></div>
  <p class="explanation" data-live data-explanation aria-live="polite"></p>
  <div class="controls" role="group" aria-label="Figure 2 playback"><button data-play>Play</button><button data-back>Back</button><button data-next>Next</button><button data-reset>Reset</button><span data-step></span><div data-hold aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div></div>
 </commit-story>
 <p class="caption">A classic two-phase-commit model with a fixed participant set, durable participant promises, an authoritative durable decision and fenced recovery. Steps show information and state, not elapsed time or CockroachDB’s native message protocol. Prepared changes are not ordinary committed rows.</p>
 <details><summary>Read the three histories</summary><p>Normal: A prepares, B prepares, COMMIT is recorded, A commits, B commits. Loss after prepare: both remain prepared until authorised recovery proves no commit decision exists and chooses ABORT. Loss after A commits: COMMIT survives and must be delivered to B. No history permits one final commit and one final abort.</p></details>
</figure>
<script>
 import {stepper} from '../../figures/stepper.mjs';
 import {schedules} from './schedules.mjs';
 class CommitStory extends HTMLElement{
  connectedCallback(){if(this.dataset.ready)return;this.dataset.ready='true';const choice=this.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('select')!;const sequence=()=>schedules[choice.value as keyof typeof schedules];const player=stepper(this,{steps:()=>sequence().length,draw:(i:number)=>{const s=sequence()[i];for(const key of ['coordinator','stock','orders'] as const)this.querySelector(`[data-${key}]`)!.textContent=s[key];this.querySelector('[data-explanation]')!.textContent=s.text;}});choice.addEventListener('change',()=>{this.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-reset]')!.click();player.render();});}
 }
 if(!customElements.get('commit-story'))customElements.define('commit-story',CommitStory);
</script>
<style>
.decision{margin:2.5rem 0;font-family:var(--font-sans)}figcaption{font:1.25rem/1.4 var(--font-serif);margin-bottom:.8rem}figcaption>span{font:.75rem var(--font-sans);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-right:.6rem}commit-story{display:block;border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);padding:1rem}label{font:.85rem/1.4 var(--font-sans);display:grid;gap:.4rem}select,button{font:.85rem/1.4 var(--font-sans);padding:.45rem;border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);border-radius:.25rem;background:var(--color-surface-alt);color:var(--color-text)}button{cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--color-accent);outline-offset:3px}.states{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr 1fr;gap:.7rem;margin:1.2rem 0}.states section{margin:0;border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);padding:.8rem;min-width:0}.states .panel-title{font:600 .85rem/1.4 var(--font-sans);margin:0}.states p:not(.panel-title){font:.95rem/1.4 var(--font-sans);min-height:3rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.explanation{font:.92rem/1.5 var(--font-sans);padding:.5rem .8rem;border-left:3px solid var(--color-accent);min-height:6rem}.controls{display:flex;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);padding-top:1rem}.controls>span{margin-left:auto;font-size:.8rem}button[aria-disabled=true]{opacity:.5}[data-hold]{width:100%;height:3px;background:var(--color-surface-alt)}[data-hold] span{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:var(--color-accent)}.caption,details{font:.85rem/1.5 var(--font-sans);color:var(--color-text-secondary)}@media(max-width:550px){.states{grid-template-columns:1fr}.states p:not(.panel-title){min-height:0;margin-bottom:0}.explanation{min-height:0}}
</style>
